      "acceptance": {
        "criteria": [
          {
            "id": "AC-1",
            "statement": "_ensure_branch 返回本次是否创建；不存在时只执行一次非 force create-only push，既有分支必须精确指向 source digest，否则 fail closed。Dispatcher 代码和测试均不得再出现 gh workflow run 创建调用。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests",
              "dependency-policy"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-2",
            "statement": "远端查询固定 repository/workflow/branch/event=push，最多读取两个结果用于唯一性判定；run 必须精确绑定 headSha/headBranch/event，响应字段类型与状态合法，多 run、绑定漂移或无效 JSON 全部失败关闭。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-3",
            "statement": "本次新建 branch 且 run 尚不可见返回 dispatched；重试发现既有 branch 且 run 尚不可见返回 pending；两条路径都只写本地 journal，不产生第二次网络创建动作。run 可见后映射 queued→pending、in_progress→running、completed success→succeeded、其他 completed conclusion→failed。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-4",
            "statement": "runtime journal 继续原子写入且只含非敏感 binding/run 状态；identity 不一致、run 消失/换 ID、attempt 回退、status 回退、completed 终态重写均拒绝。首次 dispatched/pending 在 run 延迟可见后可单调升级。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-5",
            "statement": "preflight 覆盖 dirty tree、HEAD mismatch、remote 缺失/仓库漂移与 gh auth 失败；错误只返回稳定错误码，不泄露命令 stdout/stderr、token 或环境秘密。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-6",
            "statement": "LoopSupervisor 仅在 external_execution_required 且显式 enabled 时调用 Dispatcher；external adapter 路径不 materialize、不 claim、不调用普通 Agent。未配置时保持原有只读停止语义，结构化结果保留 execution_id/branch/journal/run。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-7",
            "statement": "隔离 fake runner 覆盖首次 push、崩溃后 branch 复用、branch 冲突、零/一/多 run、queued/in_progress/success/failure、response drift、journal 恢复与 Supervisor no-Agent；实现和测试不访问真实 GitHub。",
            "verified_by": [
              "harness-tests"
            ],
            "requirement_clauses": [],
            "knowledge_claims": []
          },
          {
            "id": "AC-8",
            "statement": "CAP-KNOWLEDGE-CONTROL revision 60→61 并绑定正式 Evidence/Checkpoint；PIT-0061 记录架构歧义已由唯一服务端 branch 创建事实消除，但真实 GitHub run、artifact 与 receipt 仍由后续独立阶段验证。",
            "verified_by": [
